{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_barn","model_identifier":"halfling_barn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_barn\n\nHalfling barn: a low, wide barn of green-painted boards under a deep thatch, round-topped double doors, hay inside.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 7 columns (128 x 112 units, 3.60 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -60..60, y 0..115, z -52..45 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 46, construction_0 26, construction_33 31, construction_66 43, ruined 20 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 104 x 120 x 72 centred at x 0, z 4\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `halfling_barn_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `halfling_barn_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_halfling_barn` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -42)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"element